*** Brackets enclose the hydrogens above and below an atom ***
implicit_hydrogens/sru-amine-peak.mol:SUCCEED
implicit_hydrogens/sru-amine-valley.mol:SUCCEED
implicit_hydrogens/sru-ammonium-peak.mol:SUCCEED
implicit_hydrogens/sru-ammonium-valley.mol:SUCCEED
implicit_hydrogens/sru-silane-valley.mol:SUCCEED
*** They enclose them again after layout ***
implicit_hydrogens/sru-amine-valley-layout.mol:SUCCEED
implicit_hydrogens/sru-ammonium-valley-layout.mol:SUCCEED
implicit_hydrogens/sru-silane-valley-layout.mol:SUCCEED
*** A reaction layout leaves room for the hydrogens of an atom ***
implicit_hydrogens/reaction-with-water-layout.rxn:SUCCEED
